## Title: |cff9ec8ffAPI|r watch
## Category: Probes
## Notes: Background collector for ForeverAPI. Notices the situation you're in (open world, dungeon, raid, PvP; idle, combat, boss) and the units around you, and the first time it sees each one quietly runs the getters against it. Logs when add-on restrictions switch on and off. Stores types only. /apiwatch
